{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:31:19.270Z", "source_line": 310, "role": "user", "phase": null, "original_text_sha256": "1a3ef297e5585889a0d230847817fa5cec7123d98c5d2fbe065782dc40085a22", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "分段测量需要修改PL部分吗\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "1a3ef297e5585889a0d230847817fa5cec7123d98c5d2fbe065782dc40085a22"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:31:44.787Z", "source_line": 315, "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "original_text_sha256": "8458e7dffd9f163230213a9fcabbb092ebf4af104901c649033d29ee4482c2c8", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "**第一轮分段测量不需要修改 PL，只需在 PS 侧 C 程序中增加计时。**\n\n可以先拆出：\n\n- **预处理**：缩放、量化生成输入张量。\n- **PL 推理**：从发出 START 到收到 DONE；优先同时读取已有的硬件周期计数。\n- **后处理**：分类结果解析、检测框筛选和 NMS。\n- **结果图复制**：复制整张 720p 图像。\n- **UI 绘制与显示等待**：软件绘制、提交缓冲到实际显示。\n\n这样就能先判断你这 **1.3 秒、2.3 秒主要花在 ARM 侧还是 PL 内部**。当前已有的 `prepare_ms / graph_ms / postprocess_ms / total_ms` 可以作为基础，重点补齐复制和显示阶段。\n\n进一步要把 **PL 内部**拆成“输入等待、权重等待、PE 计算、输出 DMA”等，才需要检查板上这版 bit 是否启用了相应计数器：已启用就直接读取；未启用或缺少计数项，才需要重新构建 PL，必要时修改 RTL。\n\n建议先做 PS 侧计时，保留当前 bitstream。", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "8458e7dffd9f163230213a9fcabbb092ebf4af104901c649033d29ee4482c2c8"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:32:32.225Z", "source_line": 322, "role": "user", "phase": null, "original_text_sha256": "b049a153b3c422122e5c202c27726f3e155db71aa6a70ecb5f053699a58f0496", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "好的可以，你现在开始加吧\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "b049a153b3c422122e5c202c27726f3e155db71aa6a70ecb5f053699a58f0496"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:32:35.464Z", "source_line": 325, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "d026ba928bb9062f2bc6358a9f68d59a6552f3f670ee42ea4ff12710679cc4b6", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "我先沿用现有计时接口，在 PS 侧补齐预处理、推理、后处理、结果图复制和 UI/显示等待的统计，再编译检查。这一轮只改软件，不动 PL，也不重新生成 bitstream。\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "d026ba928bb9062f2bc6358a9f68d59a6552f3f670ee42ea4ff12710679cc4b6"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T06:34:19.290Z", "source_line": 384, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "ce288c5b72867ec4aceac7106586c35ba0887e6c93702df24d849adf2a40ec56", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "计时点已经确认。我会把“阶段总耗时”和“CPU 实际工作时间”分开记录，这样能看出预处理被 UI 绘制插入了多少等待；采样先存内存，停止推理后再导出，避免串口打印拖慢测量。\n\n另外，现有寄存器能确认显示提交被接受，但不能精确对应某个结果图的首个像素开始显示。我会将它标为“显示提交等待”，不把它当成真正的上屏时间。\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "ce288c5b72867ec4aceac7106586c35ba0887e6c93702df24d849adf2a40ec56"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T07:02:03.959Z", "source_line": 814, "role": "user", "phase": null, "original_text_sha256": "70089127fdd4a26bbc8688120c4ece0c4c7161793b3aba74c19862f7dc22ba18", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "那直接把UI删除吧，板子上的四个按键分别对应三份模型权重的切换和启动停止\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "70089127fdd4a26bbc8688120c4ece0c4c7161793b3aba74c19862f7dc22ba18"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T07:02:07.911Z", "source_line": 817, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "2da68cd13d5827d85ec2e9a2f372986240bc8b67d8a933e82285f683dd924801", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "我会删除 HDMI 软件 UI 绘制和结果图复制，改为四键控制：三个键分别切换 ResNet、NEU6、COCO80，第四个键启动/停止推理。先核对按键接线和现有模型切换流程，保留模型校验、任务排空及帧所有权保护，再编译验证。\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "2da68cd13d5827d85ec2e9a2f372986240bc8b67d8a933e82285f683dd924801"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T14:30:17.623Z", "source_line": 989, "role": "user", "phase": null, "original_text_sha256": "c3810f2eb9539402ba215b7fb7b1dc73bfb33f845aa42c536e6be26038a8bd9d", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "现在是`npu100`  了\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "c3810f2eb9539402ba215b7fb7b1dc73bfb33f845aa42c536e6be26038a8bd9d"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-01T14:30:41.500Z", "source_line": 994, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "93664f1c623c7979fe84d906f0ebc8ae0961d45d4684ad365c0986eb4b0cfb9c", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "明白，以 `AI_NPU\\npu100` 这份工程为准。刚才我把另一份 `[local_path]` 副本的运行记录混进来了，这里纠正。我会重新核对 `npu100` 的源码、构建状态和配套 Linux 软件，保持只读。\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 1, "public_text_sha256": "171d227da3563cb05d8e9d7d5b7575bfc607598ba8327b54861ca10cae5ebcb6"}
