{"timestamp": "2026-11-02T13:17:18.272Z", "source_line": 1529, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "b28178021a24120c2748f53e4c54253f32a662a20459c297099e00f5899c8216", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "确认，以 `npu100/project/npu100.xpr` 为唯一工程入口继续整理。`AI_NPU.xsa` 是该工程导出的硬件产物名称；我已核对它与Linux部署所用XSA一致，提交包中会规范命名为 `npu100.xsa`，并保留来源和哈希记录。", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "b28178021a24120c2748f53e4c54253f32a662a20459c297099e00f5899c8216"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-02T13:17:43.353Z", "source_line": 1537, "role": "user", "phase": null, "original_text_sha256": "4257fe4ed71a47ef0e83f6e53a8789eff0aea21852a45d0e386666046a07f175", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "不要和其它工程搞混了，还有很多其它的旧工程\n", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "4257fe4ed71a47ef0e83f6e53a8789eff0aea21852a45d0e386666046a07f175"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-02T13:18:03.053Z", "source_line": 1542, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "c9b998f9cfddf8075361863e42d464b65445b8c5cfd259502a58c8ecddc5858b", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "明白。PL、PS和Linux生产源码只取当前 `npu100` 工程；旧工程的RTL、约束、bit和XSA都不纳入。训练、量化及编译工具会沿最终三份模型包的来源记录反查，核对确属这条流程后再收录。每个文件都会记录来源，无法确认归属的先列入待补清单。", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "c9b998f9cfddf8075361863e42d464b65445b8c5cfd259502a58c8ecddc5858b"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-02T13:29:29.859Z", "source_line": 1731, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "769600a1023a67a21a24244e34e61631dc486a9dc0d2e1b8e950fa3f3db18926", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "已完成两项实质检查：提交包能在干净目录中重建 `npu100.xpr` 并生成BD/IP；主机工具也能从已收录的冻结输入重新生成最终三份DDR模型文件，哈希与原包一致。原始RTL、模型权重、bit和XSA保持字节不变。接下来检查总目录说明、文件清单和待补材料。", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "769600a1023a67a21a24244e34e61631dc486a9dc0d2e1b8e950fa3f3db18926"}
{"timestamp": "2026-11-02T13:36:41.870Z", "source_line": 1832, "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_text_sha256": "0f0e3b3b5d9bed8a50a66f3a4499e6620376039cbafebac8f2f4a6e0d02ea6de", "credential_redactions": 0, "text": "总复核发现一个影响开源复现的问题：Git默认转换换行符会改变部分冻结源码和原始报告的哈希。我已调整为保留文件字节，并保留模型大文件的Git LFS配置。旧主机工具中会生成224/640输入的入口也已明确停用，避免被误用于本版160/256配置。", "public_local_path_redactions": 0, "public_text_sha256": "0f0e3b3b5d9bed8a50a66f3a4499e6620376039cbafebac8f2f4a6e0d02ea6de"}
